        <section className="feature-section" id="features" style={{order:(platformContent.sections||["hero","features","templates","pricing","careers","blog","footer"]).indexOf("features"),display:(platformContent.hidden_sections||[]).includes("features")?"none":undefined}}><div className="eyebrow">EVERYTHING IN ONE PLACE</div><h2>Tools that make the<br/><em>hard part feel easy.</em></h2><div className="feature-grid"><div className="feature-card"><span>✥</span><h3>Visual website editor</h3><p>Arrange sections, update content and shape your site with a visual-first workflow.</p></div><div className="feature-card"><span>◈</span><h3>Responsive by design</h3><p>Create experiences that look considered on desktop, tablet and mobile.</p></div><div className="feature-card"><span>⌘</span><h3>Connect your stack</h3><p>Plan integrations for APIs, databases, forms and the tools your business already uses.</p></div><div className="feature-card"><span>↗</span><h3>Your own web address</h3><p>Publish on a DuKu subdomain and connect a domain you already own.</p></div></div></section>
