<article className="suite-card"><div className="suite-card-top"><span>01 / COMMERCE</span><b>SHOP</b></div><div className="suite-visual commerce-visual"><div className="commerce-product"><i></i><span>YOUR BRAND</span><b>Product catalogue</b><small>Products · SKUs · Inventory</small></div><div className="commerce-tag">Store tools</div></div><h3>Build your business online.</h3><p>Organise physical products, digital goods and services with pricing, stock tracking, product status and order records.</p><a href="#templates" onClick={()=>setFilter("Store")}>Explore store themes ↗</a></article>
